==Notable Dragons==

*'''[[Lore:Alduin|Alduin]]''' — First-Born of [[Lore:Akatosh|Akatosh]], bringer of the end times
*'''Baelthon''' — An undead skeletal Dragon in service to [[Lore:Mannimarco|Mannimarco]], the God of Worms{{ref|name=TPWaroftheWormgod|group=UOL|[[General:Ted Peterson|Ted Peterson]]'s posts in [[General:Loranna's RP/War of the Wormgod|''War of the Wormgod'']]}}
*'''[[Lore:Boziikkodstrun|Boziikkodstrun]]''' – Transformed into the first [[Lore:Daedric Titan|Daedric Titan]] by [[Lore:Molag Bal|Molag Bal]]
*'''[[Lore:Debudjen|Debudjen]]''' — A potentially fictional female Dragon mentioned in ''[[Lore:King Edward|King Edward]]''{{Ref|name=KE12}}
*'''[[Lore:Dragonne Papré|Dragonne Papré]]''' — Lived in the [[Lore:Battlespire|Battlespire]]
*'''[[Lore:Durnehviir|Durnehviir]]''' — An undead Dragon who guards the [[Lore:Soul Cairn|Soul Cairn]]
*'''[[Lore:Kaalgrontiid|Kaalgrontiid]]''' — Leader of the rage of Dragons in [[Lore:Elsweyr|Elsweyr]] in {{Year|2E 582}}
*'''[[Lore:Laatvulon|Laatvulon]]''' — A black Dragon that was said to threaten to unravel the tapestry of time 
*'''[[Lore:Lokkestiiz|Lokkestiiz]]''' — A white Dragon who posed as [[Lore:Secunda|Jone]] at the temple of Sunspire
*'''[[Lore:Maarselok|Maarselok]]''' — An azure Dragon who unleashed an enthralling disease known as the [[Lore:Azure Blight|Azure Blight]] in the [[Lore:Tenmar|Tenmar Jungle]]
*'''[[Lore:Ma-Tylda|Ma-Tylda]]''' — A potentially fictional Queen of Dragon-kind, contemporary of Akatosh{{Ref|name=KE12|{{Cite Book|King Edward, Part XII}}}}
*'''[[Lore:Nahfahlaar|Nahfahlaar]]''' — Also known as Nafaalilargus. He often allied with mortals and was a soldier of [[Lore:Tiber Septim|Tiber Septim]] — He was slain by [[Lore:Cyrus|Cyrus]] the [[Lore:Redguard|Redguard]]
*'''[[Lore:Nahviintaas|Nahviintaas]]''' — A golden Dragon who posed as [[Lore:Alkosh|Alkosh]] at the temple of [[Lore:Sunspire|Sunspire]]
*'''[[Lore:Numinex|Numinex]]''' — A legendary Dragon imprisoned for many years by [[Lore:Olaf One-Eye|King Olaf One-Eye]]
*'''[[Lore:Odahviing|Odahviing]]''' — A red Dragon who allied himself with the [[Lore:Last Dragonborn|Last Dragonborn]]
*'''[[Lore:Paarthurnax|Paarthurnax]]''' — Younger sibling to Alduin, and the one responsible for teaching the Nords how to use the [[Lore:Thu'um|thu'um]]
*'''Sahrotnax''' — A blue Dragon who was longtime enemy of the Dragonguard of [[Lore:Reman III|Reman III]] and survived many parleys with the order before finally being fatally wounded by the Nord [[Lore:Grundwulf|Grundwulf]]
*'''Shulkunaak''' — An ancient Dragon who was still alive and living in Cyrodiil circa {{Year|4E 180}} 
*'''[[Lore:Skakmat|Skakmat]]''' — [[Lore:Nulfaga|Nulfaga's]] familiar, who created the dense fog at the Battle of [[Lore:Cryngaine Field|Cryngaine Field]]{{ref|name=DC}}
*'''[[Lore:Thurvokun|Thurvokun]]''' — Abandoned the Dragon Cult and lived well into the First Era before being slain
*'''[[Lore:Tosh Raka|Tosh Raka]]''' — King of the [[Lore:Ka Po' Tun (race)|Ka Po' Tun]] who, according to popular myth, was transformed into a Dragon{{ref|name=MA}}
*'''The Wyrm of Elenglynn''' — An infamous Dragon associated with the [[Lore:Ayleid|Ayleid]] city of [[Lore:Elenglynn|Elenglynn]]. It is believed that, at some time between {{Year|3E 111}} and {{Year|3E 153}}, Sir [[Lore:Amiel Lannus|Amiel Lannus]] and the [[Lore:Knights of the Nine|Knights of the Nine]] traveled to the ruins and smote this Dragon to recover the [[Lore:Cuirass of the Crusader|Cuirass of the Crusader]]{{Ref|name=TKotN|{{Cite Book|The Knights of the Nine}}}}{{Ref|name=Prophet|[[OB:The Prophet|The Prophet]]'s dialogue}}
*'''[[Lore:Yolnahkriin|Yolnahkriin]]''' — A red Dragon who posed as [[Lore:Masser|Jode]] at the temple of Sunspire

